<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 31.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 31.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Oct 31	Oct 30	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.560     237.560     237.040    0.22 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.480     301.250     303.640   -0.71 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.085     157.130     165.490   -5.08 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.560	46.484	48.410   -3.82 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  386.800     385.360     366.280    5.60 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.100     140.115     147.886   -5.26 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.682	15.637	14.975    4.72 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  209.050     208.490     230.135   -9.16 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.866	 1.864	 1.939   -3.76 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.555	 1.575   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.185     188.975     206.030   -8.18 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
